<rdf:RDF xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
    xmlns:ifqs="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifqs#"
    xmlns:ifr="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#"
    xmlns:ifrv="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr/"
    xmlns:mz="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#"
    xmlns:mzid="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/"
    xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
    xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#"
    xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
    xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
    xmlns:schema="https://schema.org/"
    xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
    xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#">
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-ApprovalRecord">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:ApprovalRecord</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-013</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>The approving is a PROV-O activity of an agent in a role (prov:Association and prov:hadRole); the record of it is an entity. ISO 9001:2015 clause 7.5.3 and ISO 13485:2016 clause 4.2.4 ask for the approval of a controlled document before its use</mz:justification>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ApprovalRecord</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-Citation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:Citation</rdfs:label>
    <mz:addedOn>2026-11-17</mz:addedOn>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Unaligned"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-024</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>No standard adopted yet. Examined: The Citation File Format 1.2.0 is a file format with a JSON Schema and no RDF vocabulary; schema.org has the property citation, which points at a work cited and not at how a work is cited; DataCite's metadata schema and CodeMeta (to verify) describe a work's metadata, not the citation of it as a file. Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005).</mz:justification>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Citation</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-Edition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:Edition</rdfs:label>
    <mz:addedOn>2026-11-17</mz:addedOn>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Unaligned"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-011</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>No standard adopted yet. Examined: schema.org has bookEdition, a property whose value is text, not a class of what an edition is; the Bibliographic Ontology's edition is a property too (to verify); IFLA LRM has no edition among its entities, only the attribute 'edition statement' of a manifestation (to verify). None defines an edition as a release of published prose. Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005).</mz:justification>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Edition</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-Expression">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:Expression</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-003</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>LRM's Expression. schema.org's CreativeWork names no level of a work, and IFLA LRM (Work, Expression, Manifestation, Item; its namespace and IRIs are to verify) and FRBR do, so the class is a CreativeWork and the level is kept by the properties that join them</mz:justification>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>https://schema.org/CreativeWork</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Expression</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-Impact">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:Impact</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-004</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Impact</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-Manifestation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:Manifestation</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-003</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>LRM's Manifestation, the rendition. schema.org's CreativeWork names no level of a work, and IFLA LRM (Work, Expression, Manifestation, Item; its namespace and IRIs are to verify) and FRBR do, so the class is a CreativeWork and the level is kept by the properties that join them</mz:justification>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>https://schema.org/CreativeWork</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Manifestation</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-Release">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:Release</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-017</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>A release is the entity a tag names; its lineage is PROV-O's wasRevisionOf and wasDerivedFrom, and SPDX 3 names the version of a package software_packageVersion (its IRI is to verify)</mz:justification>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-ReleaseRecord">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:ReleaseRecord</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-008</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>A file is an entity; its fields follow schema.org's CreativeWork (version, identifier, isPartOf, position) and CodeMeta's software metadata (to verify)</mz:justification>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ReleaseRecord</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-ReleaseTag">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:ReleaseTag</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Maps"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-018</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>Git defines the annotated and the signed tag in its manual and publishes no RDF vocabulary, so the mapping names the manual page of git-tag</mz:justification>
    <mz:mappingRelation>closeMatch</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>https://git-scm.com/docs/git-tag</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ReleaseTag</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-Retention">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:Retention</rdfs:label>
    <mz:addedOn>2026-11-17</mz:addedOn>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Unaligned"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-027</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>No standard adopted yet. Examined: ODRL has the action delete and the constraint elapsedTime, which a policy can say as a duty to delete after a period, but it is a policy language and not a record of how long bytes are kept (to verify); ISO 15489 (records management) and PREMIS (preservation metadata) name retention and disposition without a published RDF class for it (to verify); DCAT has no retention term. Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005).</mz:justification>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Retention</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-Tombstone">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:Tombstone</rdfs:label>
    <mz:addedOn>2026-11-17</mz:addedOn>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Unaligned"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-027</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>No standard adopted yet. Examined: The DOI and DataCite practice of a tombstone page for a withdrawn record, and HTTP 410 Gone, name the behavior; no standard publishes a class for the record of a version whose bytes are removed but whose digest and metadata remain (to verify DataCite's schema). Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005).</mz:justification>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Tombstone</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-VersionScheme">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:VersionScheme</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-004</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-Work">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:Work</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-003</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>LRM's Work. schema.org's CreativeWork names no level of a work, and IFLA LRM (Work, Expression, Manifestation, Item; its namespace and IRIs are to verify) and FRBR do, so the class is a CreativeWork and the level is kept by the properties that join them</mz:justification>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>https://schema.org/CreativeWork</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifr-WorkKind">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifr:WorkKind</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0026-works-versioning FR-004</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ApprovalRecord">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Approval record</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The approval of a revision of a controlled document: a person, a role, a day and the Decision.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Citation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Citation</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">How a work is cited: its `CITATION.cff`, generated from its release record, with a DOI only where the record carries one.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#CommandLineInterface">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">command-line interface</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A command, its options and its output, which a script depends on.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:usesScheme rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#SemVer"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#CommitDateEdition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">commit-date edition</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The UTC date of the commit the edition is made at, a hyphen and the first eight characters of that commit: YYYY.MM.DD-commit8; never the clock.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:precedenceRule>the date, and where the dates are equal the later commit in the history; two editions of one commit are one edition</ifr:precedenceRule>
    <ifr:versionPattern>^[0-9]{4}[.][0-9]{2}[.][0-9]{2}-[0-9a-f]{8}$</ifr:versionPattern>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ControlledDocument">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">controlled document</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A policy or a procedure under document control: an integer revision and an approval.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:usesScheme rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#IntegerRevision"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Data">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">data</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A dataset: a snapshot with its digest, and a SemVer for its schema.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:companionScheme rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#SemVer"/>
    <ifr:usesScheme rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#SnapshotDate"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Edition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Edition</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A release of published prose, whose version is a commit-date edition.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Expression">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Expression</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A state of a work's content, which a version or an edition names: the text or the code as it was at one commit, in no form yet.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Impact">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Impact</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Major, minor or patch: what a change does to those who use the work, from which the next version is made.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#IntegerRevision">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">integer revision</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A whole number from 1 that a controlled document's revision carries, raised only with an approval record.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:precedenceRule>the number, greater is later</ifr:precedenceRule>
    <ifr:versionPattern>^[1-9][0-9]*$</ifr:versionPattern>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Library">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">library</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Code another program imports.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:usesScheme rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#SemVer"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Major">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Impact"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">major</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A change that breaks what a user of the work relied on.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:impactRank rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</ifr:impactRank>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Manifestation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Manifestation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A rendition of an expression: a PDF, an EPUB, a print run, a package; it has a format and, where printed, a printing, and no version of its own.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Minor">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Impact"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">minor</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A change that adds and breaks nothing.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:impactRank rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</ifr:impactRank>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#NoVersion">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">no version</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The scheme of a specification: it has no version, its requirement identifiers are never renumbered and its revision is the commit.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:precedenceRule>none: the commit orders the revisions</ifr:precedenceRule>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Ontology">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ontology</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A published vocabulary: its terms are its interface.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:usesScheme rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#SemVer"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Patch">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Impact"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">patch</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A change that corrects and adds nothing.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:impactRank rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</ifr:impactRank>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Prose">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">prose</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A book, a manual or a paper: published text.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:usesScheme rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#CommitDateEdition"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Release</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A version of a work that was published: it names its commit and its Git tree hash, is named by a signed annotated tag and is immutable.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ReleaseRecord">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Release record</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The typed file `&lt;work&gt;/release.ts` that names a work's kind, its identity and its present version, written by a tool and never by hand.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ReleaseTag">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Release tag</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The signed annotated Git tag `&lt;slug&gt;-v&lt;version&gt;` that makes a version a release; the ledger of releases is derived from these tags.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Retention">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Retention</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">How long the bytes of a published version are kept: digests and metadata are kept forever, bytes only for the period stated.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Schema">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">schema</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A published schema of data or of a message.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:usesScheme rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#SemVer"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#SemVer">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">SemVer</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Semantic Versioning 2.0.0: MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH with an optional pre-release; build metadata after a plus sign is not part of precedence.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:precedenceRule>SemVer 2.0.0 section 11: major, minor and patch as numbers, a pre-release before its release, build metadata ignored</ifr:precedenceRule>
    <ifr:versionPattern>^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)[.](0|[1-9][0-9]*)[.](0|[1-9][0-9]*)(-((0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)([.](0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*))?([+][0-9a-zA-Z-]+([.][0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$</ifr:versionPattern>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#SnapshotDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">snapshot date</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The day a dataset was snapshotted, YYYY-MM-DD, with the SHA-256 of the snapshot kept beside it and a SemVer for the schema of the data.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:precedenceRule>the date, later is greater; one date is one snapshot</ifr:precedenceRule>
    <ifr:versionPattern>^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$</ifr:versionPattern>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Software">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">software</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A program or a service.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:usesScheme rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#SemVer"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Specification">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">specification</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A specification: it has no version.</skos:definition>
    <ifr:usesScheme rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#NoVersion"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Tombstone">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tombstone</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">What an identifier resolves to where the bytes of a version are gone: the version's metadata, its digest and the day the bytes were removed.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Version scheme</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">One way of writing a version and ordering versions: SemVer, commit-date edition, snapshot date, integer revision or none.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Work</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A work in its identity: a slug and an IRI that never change, whatever is published of it and however often; a volume's position in a series never changes either.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Work kind</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The kind of a work, which fixes the one scheme of version it uses.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#approvalDecision">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ApprovalRecord"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">approval decision</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Decision"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Decision that records the approval.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#approvalOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ApprovalRecord"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">approval of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The revision the approval is of.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#approvedBy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ApprovalRecord"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">approved by</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The person who approved: data in the record, never inferred.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#approvedOn">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ApprovalRecord"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">approved on</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The day (YYYY-MM-DD) of the approval.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#approverRole">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ApprovalRecord"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">approver role</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The role in which the person approved.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#archivedOn">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">archived on</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The day the release was archived.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#bookEditionNumber">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Edition"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">book edition number</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The edition number a publisher prints (schema.org `bookEdition`): a label of the edition, never its version.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#bytesRemovedOn">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Tombstone"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">bytes removed on</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The day the bytes were removed.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#checksum">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">checksum</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The SHA-256 of an artifact of the release.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#citationFormat">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Citation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">citation format</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The format of the citation file: `CITATION.cff` 1.2.0.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#citationOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Citation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">citation of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The work the citation is of.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#companionScheme">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">companion scheme</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The scheme of a second version a kind carries beside its own: the schema of a dataset.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#declaredImpact">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">declared impact</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Impact"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The impact the capability that raised the version declared.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#digestKept">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Tombstone"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">digest kept</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The SHA-256 of the bytes that were removed.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#hasApproval">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has approval</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ApprovalRecord"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The approval of a revision of a controlled document.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#hasCitation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has citation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Citation"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">How the work is cited.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#hasExpression">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has expression</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Expression"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A state of the work's content.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#hasRelease">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has release</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A release of the work.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#hasRendition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Expression"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has rendition</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Manifestation"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A form the expression is rendered in.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#hasRetention">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has retention</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Retention"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">How long the bytes of the release are kept.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#identifier">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">identifier</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An external identifier of the work, such as a DOI; recorded where a work has one, never required.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#impactRank">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Impact"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">impact rank</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The rank of the impact: the greatest of the impacts of the changes is the impact of the release.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#isPartOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is part of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The work this one is a part of, such as a series (schema.org `isPartOf`).</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#isReplacedBy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is replaced by</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The release that replaces this one (Dublin Core `isReplacedBy`).</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#kind">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">kind</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The kind of the work, which fixes its scheme of version.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#position">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">position</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The work's position in the work it is part of, from 1 (schema.org `position`). It never changes.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#precedenceRule">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">precedence rule</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">How two versions of the scheme are ordered.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#printing">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Manifestation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">printing</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The printing of a print rendition, from 1; it is a property of the rendition and not a version.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#provenance">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">provenance</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The provenance attestation of the release (SLSA, in-toto), by its digest.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#realizes">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">realizes</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Expression"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The expression the release publishes.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#recordOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ReleaseRecord"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">record of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The work the record is of.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#recordPath">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ReleaseRecord"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">record path</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The path of the record, `&lt;work&gt;/release.ts`.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#releaseCommit">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">release commit</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The commit the release names, as its full object name.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#releaseIdentifier">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">release identifier</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An external identifier of this release, such as a version DOI; recorded where it has one.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#releaseOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">release of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The work the release is of.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#releaseScheme">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">release scheme</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The scheme the release's version is written in.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#releaseTag">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">release tag</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ReleaseTag"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The tag that names the release.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#releasedOn">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">released on</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The day (YYYY-MM-DD, UTC) of the release's commit, never the clock's.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#releasedOnTier">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">released on tier</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifqs#QualityTier"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The evidence tier of the quality system (0021-ifqs) the release was made on.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#renditionFormat">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Manifestation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">rendition format</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The media type of the rendition.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#replaces">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">replaces</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The release this one replaces (Dublin Core `replaces`).</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#retentionPeriod">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Retention"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">retention period</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The period after which bytes may be deleted, as an ISO 8601 duration such as P10Y.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#retiredOn">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">retired on</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The day the release was retired: still resolvable, no longer advised.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#revisionOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">revision of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The release this one revises (PROV-O `wasRevisionOf`).</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#sbom">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">SBOM</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The software bill of materials of the release (SPDX 3), by its digest.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#slug">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">slug</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The work's slug, lower-case letters, digits and hyphens: the prefix of its tags. It never changes.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#snapshotDigest">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">snapshot digest</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The SHA-256 of a dataset's snapshot, in lower-case hexadecimal.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#tagCommit">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ReleaseTag"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tag commit</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The commit the tag names.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#tagName">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ReleaseTag"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tag name</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The tag's name: the slug, `-v` and the version.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#tagSigned">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ReleaseTag"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tag signed</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Whether the tag carries a signature that verifies.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#tombstoneOf">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Tombstone"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tombstone of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The release whose bytes are gone.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#treeHash">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tree hash</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Git tree hash of that commit: what the release holds.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#usesScheme">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#WorkKind"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">uses scheme</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The one scheme of version the kind uses.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#version">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Release"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">version</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The release's version, written by the scheme of its work's kind (schema.org `version`, OWL `versionInfo`).</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#versionPattern">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#VersionScheme"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">version pattern</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The regular expression a version of the scheme matches.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#workIri">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">work IRI</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The IRI that identifies the work. It never changes.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">The vocabulary of Intellectual Frontiers Releases: a work and what it is published as, the kind of work and its one scheme of version, the release that is a signed Git tag, its retention, approval and citation.</dcterms:description>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Intellectual Frontiers Releases</rdfs:label>
    <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr/1.0.0"/>
    <owl:versionInfo>1.0.0</owl:versionInfo>
  </rdf:Description>
</rdf:RDF>
